{title: We’ve got the power}

{comment: Chorus}
We've got the power in the name of Jesus;
We've got the power in the name of the LORD;
Though Satan rages, we cannot be defeated;
For we've got the power in the name of the LORD.

{comment: Verse 1}
Come take my hand, let's agree together
That all of our enemies will crumble at our feet:
For whatever we bind on earth will be bound in Heaven
And at the name of Jesus, Satan has to flee.

{comment: Verse 2}
For many years now, Satan's tried to stop us,
But the church of Jesus is still alive:
Like a mighty army, we keep marching onward,
Winning every battle with the LORD by our side.
